[2m[2mSession[0m: [1;33mollama_kimi-k2.6_cloud-failing-tests-trial-1[0m[0m
All 15 tests pass. Here's what was fixed:

**`src/auth.py`**
- `has_permission`: added case-insensitive comparison (`required.lower() in (role.lower() for role in user_roles)`)
- `is_admin_or_owner`: changed `and` to `or` so either being admin OR matching owner_id grants access

**`src/inventory.py`**
- `__init__`: copied the mutable default argument with `dict(initial)` to prevent shared state between `Inventory` instances
- `add`: changed overwrite to accumulation (`self._stock.get(sku, 0) + qty`)
- `reserve`: changed `>=` to `>` so reserving exactly the available amount is allowed
- `release`: added a guard so releasing more than the reserved quantity raises `ValueError`

**`src/text_utils.py`**
- `slugify`: lowercased input during iteration and replaced the single `.replace("--", "-")` with `re.sub(r"-+", "-", ...)` to fully collapse repeated separators
- `truncate`: shortened the kept prefix to `max_len - len(suffix)` so the total output length respects `max_len`
